WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.232 --> 00:00:04.690
ANDREW JESSUP:
Thank you, everyone,

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.020
for coming down today.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.290
First of all, my name is Andrew.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:12.440
I've been working in Google
Cloud for about four years now.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.370
I think this is the third
time we've run a GCP Next

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.430
event in San Francisco.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.020
And every year
we've run it, it's

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.530
